      "name": "Sticky Note"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "**Setup**\nYou will need credentials for WhatsApp Business Cloud API, Google Gemini, Airtable, Google Calendar, and Google Sheets. Fill in the calendar ID, Airtable base and table, sheet ID, and phone numbers before running this workflow.",
        "height": 144,
        "width": 480
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -2000,
        704
      ],
      "id": "4a846ccc-8749-484a-bbac-5e016f075145",
      "name": "Sticky Note1"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "**Input Handling**\nFilters out invalid webhook events, then routes text messages straight through and voice notes through transcription before they reach the agent. Unsupported message types get a simple text-only notice.",
        "height": 256
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -1536,
        256
      ],
      "id": "6248183e-78ab-43d6-b014-269ffb00f421",
      "name": "Sticky Note2"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "**Voice Note Handling**\nDownloads the audio file, transcribes it with Gemini, then normalizes the text so it reaches the agent the same way a typed message would."
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -1072,
        560
      ],
      "id": "5e0a51a0-0df8-4925-9cfd-d444c336ed72",
      "name": "Sticky Note3"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "**AI Agent**\nThe core assistant. Runs on Gemini with per customer memory so it remembers the conversation, and a structured output parser so every reply comes back with a lead status the rest of the workflow can act on.",
        "width": 384
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -768,
        -64
      ],
      "id": "cdc675d3-7a16-449d-bdca-0011aa270825",
      "name": "Sticky Note4"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "**Tools**\nThe agent can look up real properties in Airtable, check real calendar availability, and book viewings. It never invents prices or slots on its own.",
        "width": 384
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -720,
        784
      ],
      "id": "fad4eb16-3e8a-44ea-b78b-519451f12464",
      "name": "Sticky Note5"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "**Reply and Escalation**\nEvery reply is sent back and logged as a lead. If the lead is hot or needs a human, the agent is notified, with a cooldown so one chatty lead does not trigger repeated alerts."
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -320,
        -32
      ],
      "id": "d80c8811-3b94-4c00-abfe-a641616befb8",
      "name": "Sticky Note6"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "**Error Handling**\nIf the AI agent fails for any reason, the customer still gets a response instead of silence, and the developer is alerted separately so the failure never goes unnoticed.",
        "width": 288
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
